  This means that the carriage isn't moving (or motion isn't being detected).
Check to see if there's any binding at all when sliding the printhead across
the carriage. If there is, strip the old lubricant off using Freon TF or some
similar solvent and then *light* re-lubricate with Teflon or lithium grease.
