The LK411 keyboard that came with our 2100 A500MP only had a 3 foot
(effective length) cord.  Way too short.  The owner's manual didn't say
anything useful and the Systems and Options Catalog only says that there is
a "keyboard port". Repeated calls to Digital came up with a bunch of "we
don't sell an extender cord and don't know if one exists".  A bit of
running around the neighboring labs turned up some PCs (we have mostly
