I've heard, OSI routing is such a resource hog, I wouldn't want to do it
anyway, if there was an alternative. The alternatives are routers and
TCP/IP. TCP/IP is cheaper. Either one will do everything I need. Also,
if I ever manage to get an internet link (I keep trying) I'll need
